Subject: vfio emulate MSI sources and expose actual passthrough attachments
Why: AC-T7.4.1: Hex's firecracker class joins guest-native GPU facts to the exact selected host PCI function only through the VMM's own assignment record, never an ordinal guess: GET /device-passthrough/{id} answers the host and guest SBDF the VMM assigned (crates/hex-runtime/src/firecracker/transport.rs attachment). A passthrough device keeps one exclusive counted MSI/MSI-X source whose guest-programmed address routes through the existing KVM irqfds, and the witness refuses when interrupt programming failed. Hex commit 2c62f12a0a4c90ea4d2a806c44797e12a582f594 on this pin.

